Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.16,0:11:43.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是在兔子形状的蛋糕上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.51,0:11:45.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yellow cake, chocolate frosting with nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.51,0:11:45.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}黄色蛋糕  有巧克力霜和坚果（nuts:坚果  也指男性睾丸）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:47.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To be fair, this one does have nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:47.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}公平来讲  你说的东西这上面的确有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:56.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mon, it was nice of you to loan Rachel your car...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:56.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  你真好啊  把车借给瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:58.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so she could get the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:58.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让她可以去换蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.51,0:12:00.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was nice of her to pull my hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.51,0:12:00.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢她一直揪我头发
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...till I dropped the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直到我把钥匙丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.77,0:12:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, while we're waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.77,0:12:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然闲着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:06.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you could tape your message to Emma...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:06.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们就先录一段
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:09.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for her 18th birthday, huh? Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:09.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给艾玛的十八岁生日的祝福  好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.75,0:12:12.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Emma. It's the year 2020.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.75,0:12:12.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾玛  现在是2020年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.78,0:12:14.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you still enjoying your nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.78,0:12:14.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还在享受你的午觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:20.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're Aunt Monica and Uncle Chandler, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:20.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是莫妮卡姑姑和钱德勒姑父
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:22.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You may not recognize us...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:22.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可能不认识我们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.08,0:12:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because we haven't spoken
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.08,0:12:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我们已经十七年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:25.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to your parents in 17 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:25.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有和你父母亲讲话了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:27.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We used to be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:27.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们曾经结过婚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But then we missed a weekend away together,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们搞砸了我们的一个周末
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:30.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and things kind of unraveled...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:30.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}造成我们分开
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.20,0:12:32.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.20,0:12:32.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是因为你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.97,0:12:35.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.97,0:12:35.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.77,0:12:37.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, Rachel promised
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.77,0:12:37.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  瑞秋答应过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:39.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}it would be over by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:39.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}派对这时候会完
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.35,0:12:40.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We seriously have to go
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.35,0:12:40.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们如果要去佛蒙特
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.89,0:12:41.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}if we want to get to Vermont.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.89,0:12:41.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在该出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:43.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I called them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:43.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我打电话问过他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:44.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the last train leaves in a half-hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:44.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最后一班火车在半小时后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:46.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I have a massage client soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:46.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有要按摩的客户
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:49.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys, just, please, a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:49.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:50.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:50.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:51.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel will be back with the cake any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:51.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋随时会带蛋糕回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:55.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, remember the frosting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:55.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  记得该店的奶油味道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:57.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, five more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:57.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我再等五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.39,0:13:03.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.39,0:13:03.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是吧  发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:06.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, okay, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:06.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的  好的  你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我马上过去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:10.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was that Emma?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:10.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是不是艾玛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:11.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is she up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:11.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她起来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel got pulled over for speeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋因超速被警察拦下来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She forgot her license.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:16.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他忘了带驾照
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:16.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to bring it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:16.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得送过去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:19.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're leaving, I'm definitely going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:19.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你要走那我也得走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:22.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, if anybody gets to go, it's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:22.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果有人要走那就是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:24.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've been complaining the longest!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:24.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是抱怨最久的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:27.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, wait, you guys. No, you can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:27.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等  你们不能走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel already feels bad that the cake's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蛋糕的事已让瑞秋很烦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.93,0:13:33.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you think she'll feel
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.93,0:13:33.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果回来时发现大家不在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:34.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}when she comes back and you're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:34.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那她会怎么想
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:36.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. You'll tell us on Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:36.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道  你礼拜一才会告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:40.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, you're in charge, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:40.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  你负责这里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:41.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You make sure nobody leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:41.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁也不许走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.99,0:13:43.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.99,0:13:43.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}了解
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:47.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey! Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:47.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿嘿嘿  你要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:48.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:48.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去洗手间啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:51.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, the rest of you get comfortable,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:51.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家怎么舒服怎么来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.11,0:13:52.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because we are gonna be here for a--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.11,0:13:52.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我们还要待在这...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.77,0:13:55.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, there's a window in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.77,0:13:55.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等  洗手间里有个窗户...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:57.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No! He's not getting away that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:57.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要让他逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:01.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:01.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:02.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:02.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快滚出去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:11.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that one did not have Emma's face on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:11.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个"小弟弟"上没有艾玛的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:14.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, it did not. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:14.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是  没有  -对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:17.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we'd better get going. It's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:17.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经很晚了  我们真的要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.94,0:14:19.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Jack can't drive at night anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.94,0:14:19.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}杰克不能在晚上开车了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:21.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He has trouble staying in his lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:21.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不能保持在自己的车道里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:23.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Last winter I went up on a church lawn
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:23.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去年冬天我开车经过教堂的草地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:25.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and drove right through a manger scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:25.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后撞上马的食槽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:27.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The papers thought it was a hate crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:27.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}报纸误以为那是报复性犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:34.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Anyway, it was lovely seeing you. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:34.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-无论如何  很高兴可以见到你们  -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Bye. Bye, dear. - Nighty-night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:37.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-再见  -晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.13,0:14:38.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Nighty-night. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.13,0:14:38.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-晚安  -再见.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:41.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How could you just let them leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:41.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  你怎么可以让他们走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:42.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:42.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:43.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna mess with Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:43.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会和杰克过不去的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:45.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a great man. He fought for our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:45.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是一个能为国家而战的伟人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.29,0:14:47.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.29,0:14:47.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他才没有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:48.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He pretended to be a Quaker
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:48.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他装成贵格会教徒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to get out of Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:49.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才可以逃离韩国
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that's it. He's the last one to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}够了  他是最后一个退出的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:55.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm locking you guys in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:55.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我把门锁上了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.34,0:14:57.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You do know I can just turn them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.34,0:14:57.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道那个锁是
